ts.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Learn the story about a complicated character that combines the characteristics of a villain and a noble knight, but gives no pretext for clearly define his moral choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054820/extras/4c437ed9b3bcb2d36e605c13472e79ba.poster.avif?t=1728554526\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054820/extras/4c437ed9b3bcb2d36e605c13472e79ba.webm?t=1728554526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1054820/extras/4c437ed9b3bcb2d36e605c13472e79ba.mp4?t=1728554526\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>",
